      "route": "PATCH /api/v2/assets/:uid/",
      "kind": "request-schema",
      "message": "must match exactly one schema in oneOf",
      "category": "vendor-spec-wrong",
      "reason": "The PATCH body is a PolymorphicProxySerializer oneOf of AssetPatchRequestContent {content, name}, AssetPatchRequestDataSharing {data_sharing} and AssetPatchRequestTagString {tag_string}. As a PATCH, drf-spectacular emits them with no required fields and no additionalProperties: false, so every JSON object matches all three and the oneOf can never pass. KPI itself validates the body with AssetSerializer(partial=True), which accepts {name, content} (content parsed from a JSON string by WritableJSONField).",
      "evidence": "https://github.com/kobotoolbox/kpi/blob/bcb83887a120c7ca85cedfa749bf7e994cc0a9e1/kpi/schema_extensions/v2/assets/serializers.py#L51-L89 ; https://github.com/kobotoolbox/kpi/blob/bcb83887a120c7ca85cedfa749bf7e994cc0a9e1/kpi/views/v2/asset.py#L295 ; https://github.com/kobotoolbox/kpi/blob/bcb83887a120c7ca85cedfa749bf7e994cc0a9e1/kpi/fields/writable_json.py#L20-L30"
